<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has built a 90km network of military roads across southern Lebanon, including a road in the Shebaa Valley buffer zone, and established new bases, expanding its footprint. Hezbollah continues artillery fire on Israeli positions and has begun cash payments to war victims and displaced families. Israeli strikes have wounded a Lebanese footballer and led to the detention of a 65‑year-old retired engineer. Protests against Israeli attacks on Palestine and Lebanon occurred in Sweden. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon, and there were 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQWnhnR3otZXI4V21ac09VcHRtT0t2dXlsSFltR2M3MDdKMjlibXlpbTJWTk1RMU4yNEhMSUItNk5BTkdWekdXYzY4alpNcGRsbjRMb3h3YjNiTTVySUhGVzNWZ1ljVEJBcS1FWXFaSWwteGtBd3d1Vy1xNndfQkt5ZjlUdmVXZ3JwMkpITy1BMEpUSk52UlB4dXNHOTVlR0Vx?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Federal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNWmdZaU1HaExBay1qTnJEZHFZWWdQZGZ3QzVHMFBOeGduWjV6SENaN29fWU92ODg3RVZBNGtGeUlKU2p4RmJKckF5Y0dkdnp5UFJNWWpqcVJZeUNyOGd0emlWVU11cGpuOVdyODJNVjl2ckQ1UVBSeUFzaDlFd05XWnN6aFFteGlnVms0bzlzNTVrMFBkUld2el9OMkUzRndyNmVjYndxMUxfUV9EcEw5WDU1U1I0MnNLMXNCSXE0TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;LBCI Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.khqa.com/news/nation-world/saudi-arabia-intercepts-missiles-as-aramco-building-in-riyadh-is-damaged-and-other-mideast-news/article_3cecadd1-7adb-578c-9afe-ebc34dcc1aba.html&quot;&gt;khqa.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.timeslive.co.za/news/world/2026-11-08-netanyahu-rival-gadi-eise